#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:503
msgid ""
"Word wrap is a feature that causes the editor to automatically start a new "
"line of text and move (wrap) the cursor to the beginning of that new line. "
"KateView will automatically start a new line of text when the current line "
"reaches the length specified by the Wrap Words At: option.<p><b>NOTE:<b> "
"Word Wrap will not change existing lines or wrap them for easy reading as in "
"some applications."
msgstr ""
"woord oorvloei is 'n funksie wat veroorsaak die redigeerder aan "
"auaanmatically begin 'n nuwe lyn van teks en beweeg (oorvloei) die "
"plekaanduier aan die begin van wat nuwe lyn. kateview sal auaanmatically "
"begin 'n nuwe lyn van teks wanneer die huidige lyn bereik die lengte "
"gespesifiseer deur die oorvloei woords at: opsie.<p><b>note:<b> woord "
"oorvloei sal nie verander existing lyns of oorvloei diem fof maklike lees as "
"in sommige programme."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:504
msgid ""
"If the Word Wrap option is selected this entry determines the length (in "
"characters) at which the editor will automatically start a new line."
msgstr ""
"as die woord oorvloei opsie is gekose this inskrywing bepaal die lengte (in "
"karakters) na wat die redigeerder sal automnaically begin 'n nuwe line."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:505
msgid ""
"KateView will replace any tabs with the number of spaces indicated in the "
"Tab Width: entry."
msgstr ""
"kateview sal vervang enige oortjies met die nommer van spasies aangedui in "
"die oortjie width: inskrywing."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:506
msgid ""
"If the Replace Tabs By Spaces option is selected this entry determines the "
"number of spaces with which the editor will automatically replace tabs."
msgstr ""
"as die vervang oortjies deur spasies opsie is gekose this inskrywing bepaal "
"die nommer van spasies met wat die redigeerder sal automaties vervang "
"oortjies."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:507
msgid ""
"KateView will automatically eliminate extra spaces at the ends of lines of "
"text."
msgstr ""
"kateview sal automaties elimineer addisionele spasies na die einde van lyne "
"van teks."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:508
msgid ""
"When the user types a left bracket ([,(, or {) KateView automatically enters "
"the right bracket (}, ), or ]) to the right of the cursor."
msgstr ""
"wanneer die gebruiker tipes 'n links hakkie ([,(, of {) kateview automaties "
"binne gaan die regterkant hakkie (}, ), of ]) aan die regterkant van die "
"cursof."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:509
msgid ""
"Checking this will cause sequences of similar actions to be undone at once."
msgstr ""
"toetsing hierdie sal veroorsaak herhalings van soortgelyk aksies aan wees "
"ondoen na as eers."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:510
msgid ""
"The editor will display a symbol to indicate the presence of a tab in the "
"text."
msgstr ""
"die redigeerder sal vertoon 'n simbool aan aandui die voorkoms van 'n "
"oortjie in die teks."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:512
msgid ""
"If this is selected, the insertion cursor will be moved to the first/last "
"line when pressing the page up/down buttons.<p>If not selected, it will "
"remain at it's relative position in the visible text."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie is gekose, die invoeg plekaanduier sal wees verskuif aan die "
"eerste/laaste lyn wanneer gedruk die bladsy begin/ondertoe butaanns.<p>as "
"nie gekose, dit sal bly na dit's relnaive posdition in die visible teks."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:513
msgid ""
"Sets the number of undo/redo steps to record. More steps uses more memory."
msgstr ""
"verstel die nommer van herstel/herstel herroep stappe aan opneem. meer "
"stappe gebruik meer geheue."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:514
msgid ""
"When on, moving the insertion cursor using the <b>Left</b> and <b>Right</b> "
"keys will go on to previous/next line at beginning/end of the line, similar "
"to most editors.<p>When off, the insertion cursor cannot be moved left of "
"the line start, but it can be moved off the line end, which can be very "
"handy for programmers."
msgstr ""
"wanneer op, beweeg die insertiop plekaanduier te gebruik die <b>links</b> en "
"<b>regterkant</b> sleutels sal gaan op aan vorige/volgende lyn na begin/"
"einde van die lyn, soortgelyk aan mees ediaanrs.<p>wanneer vanf, die "
"insertiop plekaanduier kan nie wees verskuif links van die lyn begin, maar "
"dit kan wees verskuif vanf die lyn einde, wat kan wees baie heny vir "
"programmeerders."

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:555
msgid "Background:"
msgstr "background:"

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:568
msgid "Sets the background color of the editing area"
msgstr "verstel die agtergrond kleur van die redigering area"

#: part/kateviewdialog.cpp:569
msgid ""
"Sets the background color of the selection. To set the text color for "
"selected text, use the &quot;<b>Configure Highlighting</b>&quot; dialog."
